.TH PHX-DOCK 1 "2026-09-05" "Phalanx Duel" "Phalanx Duel Local Tooling"
.SH NAME
phx-dock \- run explicit containerized verification
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bin/dock
.I command
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B bin/dock
runs a command in the Docker Compose
.B automation
service using the dev profile. Docker must already be running. This is for
isolated verification and automation; it is not the host-native demo or local
Postgres path.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -h, --help
Show usage and exit successfully.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
bin/dock pnpm verify:full
bin/dock pnpm test
bin/dock bash
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR phx-demo (1),
.BR phx-services (1),
.BR phx (1)
